overflow. Matches the policy Color.hpp documents for Color::fromHex. Added the
first headless coverage of formatDuration, parseDuration, formatDurationQString
and srtTimecode. The two integration ctest entries are excluded: they need
GL/audio hardware and hang headless (measured 17min before being bounded).
